meta {
  name: Toggle Homepage
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/project/updateShowOnHomePage/{{projectId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  # Toggle Homepage

  Admin only. Flips `showOnHomepage` — there is no body, so calling it twice
  returns the project to its original state. `message` says which way it went.

  | Status | Meaning |
  | --- | --- |
  | 200 | flipped |
  | 401 | missing or expired token |
  | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` |
}
